# Normalise text to LF in the repository. The working tree keeps whatever the checkout produces;
# git compares through this filter, so a CRLF file already on disk is not reported as modified.
* text=auto

# Explicitly binary. Fonts, icons and the SQLite fixtures must never be line-ending converted --
# a single byte change in a .ttf breaks font loading, and in a .png it corrupts the image.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.zip binary
*.sha256 binary

# Windows-only project: the C++ runner and its CMake files are edited by Visual Studio tooling that
# expects CRLF, but the build reads either. Keep them normalised like everything else in the tree.

# Vendored upstream sources. Marking these keeps GitHub's language statistics measuring this
# project's own Dart and C# rather than the GameHelper snapshot under third_party/.
third_party/gamehelper/** linguist-vendored
third_party/wanghan008-poe2/** linguist-vendored
tracker_host/Assets/Localization/*.json linguist-generated
lib/l10n/app_localizations*.dart linguist-generated
